artList","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPartList","abstract":[{"text":"The part-list identifies the different musical parts in this document. Each part has an ID that is used later","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"within the musical data. Since parts may be encoded separately and combined later, identification elements are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"present at both the score and score-part levels. There must be at least one score-part, combined as desired","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with part-group elements that indicate braces and brackets. Parts are ordered from top to bottom in a score","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"based on the order in which they appear in the part-list.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLPartList"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLPartList"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlpartlist"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"type":"topic","title":"IvorMXL","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}],"role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLDefaults":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLDefaults"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The defaults type specifies score-wide defaults for scaling; whether or not the file is a concert score;","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"layout; and default values for the music font, word font, lyric font, and lyric language. Except for the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"concert-score element, if any defaults are missing, the choice of what to use is determined by the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"application.","type":"text"}],"